[36m(main_task pid=77121)[0m <information>Issachar Jacox Roberts, a Native American legal scholar and politician, was a member of the Delaware and Munsee tribes, and later a U.S. diplomat and politician. He is often credited as the first Native American from the Delaware and Munsee tribes to serve as a minister and the first Native American attorney.
